{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_06DF10","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Granin的研究资料，你是怎么弄到的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"也是Coldman。他好像动用了CIA的情报网弄到手的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"先把偷来的情报交给你，再拿这件事要挟你……真够狠的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我一眼就知道那是Granin的研究。因为在那之前，我和他已经来往过几封信。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"写信？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我们研究的领域相近……他也一直感叹，没人理解双足步行研究。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"原来如此……他所说的“美国朋友”，就是你啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"当然，我们在信里从没谈过技术本身。不过有一次，他写过这样一句话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"“如果我出了什么意外，就把这项研究托付给你。总比交给那些连科学是什么都不懂的家伙有用。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"很像他会说的话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"后来他的研究真的送到了我手上。这样一来，Granin遭遇了什么也不难想象。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"我当时想，继承他的遗志也许也是我的责任……而且。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"而且什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"如果把Granin的技术和我的研究结合起来，不也可以算是一种东西方融合吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"就像Apollo和Soyuz的对接计划一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"这种历史永远不会见光。而且，这也不是你偷偷使用别人研究的理由。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"……是啊。你说得对。我是个懦夫。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"我一直没有勇气说出真相。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"为了掩饰这一点，我一直都在找借口。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"你现在不是已经说出来了吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"Snake……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":14,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"你已经把一切都好好说出来了。你不再是懦夫。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""}]}